<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="996ae1a3">The benefits reports and scorecards will show the actual performance of the program/project benefits compared to the
expected performance. Where performance is significantly different to expected or where it has been consistently
underperforming over at least two reporting periods, it should be highlighted as an area of concern and reviewed
with&amp;nbsp;key stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;</attribute>
